{"ref":"BDB, בִּכּוּרִים","hw":"בִּכּוּרִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכּוּרִים</span></big>  <strong>n.m. first-fruits</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.14\">Lv 2:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.17\">23:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:26\" href=\"/Numbers.28.26\">Nu 28:26</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:42\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.42\">2 K 4:42</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:12\" href=\"/Nahum.3.12\">Na 3:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:31\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.31\">Ne 13:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכֻּרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.20\">Lv 23:20</a> (P); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכּוּרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:16\" href=\"/Exodus.23.16\">Ex 23:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:19\" href=\"/Exodus.23.19\">19</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:22\" href=\"/Exodus.34.22\">34:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:26\" href=\"/Exodus.34.26\">26</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:20\" href=\"/Numbers.13.20\">Nu 13:20</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:13\" href=\"/Numbers.18.13\">18:13</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.36\">Ne 10:36</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.30\">Ez 44:30</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכּוּרֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.14\">Lv 2:14</a>;—the first of grain and fruit that ripened and was gathered and offered to god according to the ritual; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם הַבִּכּוּרִים</span> bread made of the new grain offered at Pentecost <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.20\">Lv 23:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יום הבכורים</span> <em>day</em> of the first-fruits (Pentecost) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:26\" href=\"/Numbers.28.26\">Nu 28:26</a>.","next":"BDB, בַּל","prev":"BDB, בִּכּוּרָה"}